{
  "flow": "weapon_scan",
  "version": "1.1.0",
  "profile": "android_3200x1440",
  "description": "流程一：武器背包全量扫描 → GoodWeapon (GOOD v3)",
  "vars": {
    "total": "int",
    "seen": "set<fingerprint>",
    "results": "list<GoodWeapon>"
  },
  "steps": [
    {
      "do": "enterScreen",
      "target": "weapon_backpack",
      "chain": [
        "game_home→bagpack(2786,36)"
      ],
      "anchor": {
        "kind": "ocr",
        "rect": "$screens._common.titleBar",
        "expect": "背包",
        "retries": 3
      },
      "note_split1": "2026-09-13：入口链拆两段（对齐 artifact_scan）。第一段只开背包并**确认标题条含「背包」**——否则第 2 击（weapon_tab）会落到还在加载或别的界面上，误触后整条流程带错跑。标题条 ROI `screens._common.titleBar` 为 2244 实测定标（51 张截图标题块包络 x[120,643] y[19,97]），背包页读作 `背包/圣遗物` 或 `背包／武器`。"
    },
    {
      "do": "enterScreen",
      "target": "weapon_backpack",
      "chain": [
        "weapon_tab(210,196,290,321)"
      ],
      "anchor": {
        "kind": "ocr",
        "rect": "$screens._common.titleBar",
        "expect": "武器",
        "retries": 3
      },
      "note_split2": "第二段：切武器页签后**确认标题条含「武器」**。⚠️ 不能只匹配 `背包` —— 背包页与武器页都含「背包」无法区分；「武器」才是武器页独有判据（实测 `背包／武器` 置信 0.93）。"
    },
    {
      "do": "readCount",
      "rect": "$screens.weapon_backpack.count",
      "as": "total",
      "onZero": "reopenAndRetry"
    },
    {
      "do": "pagedGrid",
      "grid": "weapon_backpack",
      "scrollToTop": true,
      "fingerprintSkip": true,
      "visit": [
        {
          "do": "stopWhen",
          "mode": "duplicateStreak",
          "streak": 3,
          "dupPageConfirm": 2,
          "action": "Stop",
          "note": "阈值不再承担「回卷」判据：pagedGrid 内引擎按**该网格一页的卡片数**（cols×traverseRows）自动覆盖（见 ScanEngine.dupLimitEffective）；此处的 3 仅作 snap/rosterFind 等非翻页路径的兜底。"
        },
        {
          "do": "stopWhen",
          "expr": "rarity <= 2",
          "action": "Stop+flush",
          "note": "恢复（2026-09-17）：删除后并未解决 1★ 漏件（漏仍为 2），反而让低星区多录 7 件 ⇒ 回退。1★ 漏件的真因待查（疑与列表到底判据有关）。"
        },
        {
          "do": "vote",
          "zone": "weapon.card.lockBadge",
          "passes": 3,
          "as": "locked"
        },
        {
          "do": "click",
          "fast": {
            "at": "$cell.center"
          },
          "fallback": [
            {
              "kind": "ocrAnchor",
              "region": "$panel.weapon_backpack.name"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "do": "vote",
          "zone": "weapon.panel.starBand",
          "as": "rarity",
          "note": "★ 2026-09-11：星级改由**详情面板星行**判定（必须排在 click 之后——面板显示的是选中件）。卡片 starStrip 在 3★/4★ 边界抖动（同件两次 3★/4★，36 件中 10 件）；面板星行固定坐标、大而清晰，逐格金像素>100 计亮格数=星数。代价：低星件也要点一下才能知道星级（stopWhen 因此略滞后，可接受）。"
        },
        {
          "do": "parsePanel",
          "panel": "weapon_backpack",
          "fields": [
            "name",
            "slot",
            "mainLabel",
            "mainValue",
            "baseLabel",
            "baseValue",
            "level",
            "refine",
            "equipped"
          ],
          "dict": {
            "name": "mappings.weapons",
            "fuzzy": 1
          }
        },
        {
          "do": "emit",
          "as": "GoodWeapon",
          "compose": {
            "rarity": "$rarity",
            "locked": "$locked"
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "endConditions": [
    "stopWhen 触发",
    "pagedGrid 自然遍历完（总数核对 total==len(results)）"
  ],
  "pending": [
    "swipe settle 真机",
    "2★ 绿色底色旁证补采样（非阻断）"
  ]
}
